```c
static int dirent_name_cmp(const void *a, const void *b)
{
    const struct dirent *da = *(const struct dirent *const *)a;
    const struct dirent *db = *(const struct dirent *const *)b;
    return strcmp(da->d_name, db->d_name);
}
```

`strcmp` performs unsigned-byte comparison per the C standard, which is exactly "ascending raw-byte order."

